                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Define a data output to be accessed from ShapeDiver's viewer API.
Supports the following data types:
scalar, string, guid, point and vector, color, box, interval, line, ray, plane, transform, nurbs curve and surface.
The viewer API will output the data as a JavaScript object which preserves the tree structure.</item>
